{{!
    Fallback preview of the proposed commands before a confirmation: per command the skill name and
    its raw input. Only used when the server sends no preview of its own for the confirmation.

    Rendered by aiinstructions.js (preview type command_list).

    @template bookingextension_agent/command_list

    @package    bookingextension_agent
    @copyright  2026 Wunderbyte GmbH <info@wunderbyte.at>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * commands - List of proposed commands, each with:
      * skill - The skill name.
      * input - The command input as JSON text.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "commands": [
            {"skill": "course.create_course", "input": "{\"fullname\":\"Test course\"}"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="booking-ai-run-status-inline card mb-0">
    <div class="card-body p-3">
        <h6 class="mb-2">{{#str}}ai_js_proposed_actions, bookingextension_agent{{/str}}</h6>
        <ul class="mb-0 pl-3">
            {{#commands}}
            <li><strong>{{#str}}ai_js_skill_label, bookingextension_agent{{/str}}</strong> {{skill}}<br/><small class="text-muted">{{input}}</small></li>
            {{/commands}}
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
